L361: Maximal Running Speed Test
L362: The exercise began with a 5‐min warm‐up at a speed of 10 m min −1 . Thereafter, the running speed increased by 3 m min −1  every 3 min until it reached 28 m min −1 . Thereafter, the speed was further increased by 1 m min −1  each minute until the mice were unable to continue. [ 
