L367: Maximal Grip Strength Test
L368: The grip strength test was performed to measure the forelimb grip strength with a digital grip‐strength meter. The grip strength test was repeated five times, and the maximal value was selected as the forelimb grip strength, then, normalized by body weight. [ 
